@startuml

participant Host as H
participant Device as D

H -> D: Read Addr 3 CV 8
note over D
  No active query, accept and execute
end note
D --> H: Ack level 1

H -> D: Read CV Addr 4 CV 8
note over D
  Currently busy with earlier query
end note
D --> H: Reply level 1 - Busy

note over D
  Done with query, forward Result
end note
D -> H: Reply level 2 - Result / Error 
H --> D: Ack level 1

@enduml